{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売ですよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一足お先に拝見しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カバネリ特集も1ページ1ページ熱い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督の荒木さんのインタビューページ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共感するところが沢山あって、気付いたら泣いてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"繰り返し読んじゃいますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も仕事現場に持って来てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌のインタビューからこんなにも勇気を貰えると改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も誰かを励ませられる様な言葉を使いたいと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に今回この様な機会を下さりありがとうございましたっ！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りのオフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にしても、無名ちゃん可愛すぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁかわいい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のカバネリは今朝観たよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張れるっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あとさっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月のニュータイプの付録、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターハイスピもあるよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よきよき(^-^)(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり、ショタまこ至高。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の連載ページもよくこの企画出来たなっ\n(ง ˙ω˙)ว ボハアッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腰抜かしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとねー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文豪ストレイドッグスみてたらね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊ニュータイプのCMが流れてきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら私の記事も紹介されてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名だたる役者の方々、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ作品の紹介の中にあった事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲んでいたお茶をこぼしてしまった程身体に嬉しい電流流れましたっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい事あるんだね(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生(´；ω；｀)⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文豪ストレイドックスは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"敦くんをめちゃ応援してるよう(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中原中也さんもかっこよいかっこよい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡花ちゃん( ^ω^ )ジュルリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画も買おうかなっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嗚呼っ┌（┌ ＾o＾）┐2次元最高っ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、最近買った漫画はイノサン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしいっっっ☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ジャンポリがあるよっ(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"銀魂しばりのFCC開催するよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も素晴らしいレイヤーの方々がいらっしゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻血"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次は沸騰ワード10に出演するよ(ง ˙ω˙)ว"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナマンさんと乃木中以外ではお久しぶりにテレビ出れて嬉しかったな〜(´；ω；｀)⭐️⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと共演したいなっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標だね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その次はミュージックステーションヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リード曲の『きっかけ』を披露します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非お楽しみにっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そのあとはっっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ46時間TVが始まりますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも、スタッフさんも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてファンの皆様もみんな楽しい46時間になる様に頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらくから、ぐっと距離が近くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれちい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/06/10/2375943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}